# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  AutoZapret - repository ignore rules
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# research material: cloned upstreams, huge, not ours to publish
refs/
_refs/
__refs/

# zapret binaries: fetched by tools\fetch-engine.ps1, never committed
#
# NOTE: this does NOT mean they are missing from the release. Two different
# things live here:
#   * git  - source code and data (assets\: strategies, fakes, lists, hosts).
#            Binaries are excluded because they are large, licensed separately
#            (WinDivert LGPLv3, cygwin GPL) and reproducible from a script.
#   * ZIP  - what a person downloads. It contains everything: AutoZapret.exe,
#            WebView2Loader.dll, engine\bin\winws.exe, WinDivert64.sys, lua\,
#            assets\ (with lists and hosts), tools\.
# Verified by tools\check-artifact.js on every CI run - it opens the built zip
# and fails if any of those files is missing.
engine/
engine-*/
*.sys
WinDivert*.dll
cygwin1.dll
winws.exe
winws2.exe
elevator.exe
killall.exe

# .NET build output
bin/
obj/
publish/
stage/
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.cache

# Android: нативная tun2socks собирается android\build-hev.cmd из refs\hev-socks5-tunnel
android/AutoZapret.Android/libs/
android/**/bin/
android/**/obj/
*.rsp
*.suo
*.user
*.deps.json
*.runtimeconfig.json
AutoZapret.dll

# WebView2 SDK is fetched by tools\fetch-webview2.ps1, keep it out of the repo
lib/webview2/*.dll
lib/webview2/*.xml

# runtime state: settings, strategy scores, proxy secret, logs
#
# data/ целиком — это состояние конкретной машины: настройки, логи, счётчики,
# бэкапы hosts, отчёты headless-прогонов. Продуктовые данные живут в assets/,
# поэтому здесь нечего отслеживать. Правило целиком, а не по подпапкам: иначе
# каждый новый каталог (как data/headless) тихо попадает в коммит.
data/
*.log
logs/
launcher.log
selftest*.txt

# локальный CI (tools\ci-local.ps1): пакеты, логи прогонов, расширенные отчёты
artifacts/

# generated lists: downloaded, regenerated, never committed
data/lists/*.txt
!assets/lists/*.txt

# assets/lists/*.txt IS committed on purpose, and it is NOT a duplicate of
# engine/lists. It is the offline fallback that ships inside the package:
# if GitHub is unreachable (blocked, offline, first run on a fresh machine),
# BundledLists.Restore() lays these out into engine\lists and the bypass works
# from the first start instead of "engine alive, no effect".
#
# assets/hosts/* is committed for the same reason: ready-made hosts fixes and
# one large curated hosts, usable without network.
!assets/lists/**
!assets/hosts/**

# generated payloads (the .bin fakes) - shipped subset lives in assets/fakes
data/fakes/
*.bin.upd

# NOTE: assets/strategies/*.json IS committed on purpose.
# It is the product's core data (44 strategies with ${BIN}/${LISTS} placeholders,
# fully portable). Regenerating from .bat is a dev-time operation via
# `AutoZapret.exe --strategies`, and CI has no refs/ to regenerate from.

# secrets and signing
*.pfx
*.snk
*.key
*.pem

# editor / OS noise
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# local scratch
tmp/
scratch/
*.7z
*.zip
*.tmp
*.bak

# but DO keep the hand-written assets
!assets/**/*.ico
!assets/**/*.png
!assets/fakes/**/*.bin

# temporary commit-message files (git add -A after writing one of these
# has already polluted the history twice - do not let it happen again)
cmsg*.txt

# preview.html - страница, собранная tools\preview.js для просмотра в браузере.
# Это артефакт сборки, а не исходник: ui.html + theme.css + app.js в одном файле.
preview.html
